nd your soul withers away, leaving behind an empty shell to aimlessly wander the abyss.\n\nBut fate still has plans for you.\n\nA mysterious mage appears, granting you a Golden Soul and saving you from eternal oblivion. Your real soul holds your personality, memories, and emotions. The Golden Soul is a magical imitation that prolongs your existence \u2013 but you feel nothing. No blood courses through your veins, no morality guides your actions.\n\nReclaim your former self. Uncover how you ended up at the edge of the abyss and what ties you to the magical cataclysm slowly devouring the world.", "summary": "Who should rule the human's fate: The human itself or an abstract god?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/golden-soul--1", "videos": [{"id": 146037, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "0VchivWOmb0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0VchivWOmb0", "title": "Golden Soul - Official Trailer [EN]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0VchivWOmb0/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}